noble.js: one bundle of @noble/curves 1.9.7, @noble/hashes 1.8.0 and @noble/ciphers 1.3.0 (MIT, Paul Miller, https://paulmillr.com/noble/),
exposing TaosNoble.{RistrettoPoint, ORDER, p256, sha256, sha512, hkdf, hmac, gcm}. Built with esbuild (--bundle --format=iife
--global-name=TaosNoble --minify) from an entry file that re-exports those names. sha256: e3147b8fb5e2c04a1ded0c0b58e8b2a9c2a3b298c602ae77f0df9f16966a0c93

WebCrypto (crypto.subtle) is not available to pages served over plain HTTP, so the page uses these pure JavaScript, audited libraries instead.

